Note on datasets and third-party weights:
The BSDS500, BIPED, and UDED datasets used to evaluate this work are subject
to their own licenses and must be obtained from their original sources.
This license does NOT grant any rights to those datasets.

experiments/weights/zerodce_epoch99.npz is a format conversion of the official
Zero-DCE weights (Guo et al., CVPR 2020), which are released for academic
research only under CC BY-NC 4.0. That file is NOT covered by the MIT license
above; see experiments/weights/README.md.
